        "created_at": "2013-06-22T19:18:15.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That makes sense. We were actually pretty surprised they weren't nemeses to begin with. We tried to imagine what the Young Legacy-Iron Legacy interactions would be like (\"I SAW YOU DIE\"), but kind of defaulted to Wizard People. It's one of our default defaults.</p>",
