        "raw": "<p>That makes sense. We were actually pretty surprised they weren&#39;t nemeses to begin with. We tried to imagine what the Young Legacy-Iron Legacy interactions would be like (&quot;I SAW YOU DIE&quot;), but kind of defaulted to Wizard People. It&#39;s one of our default defaults.</p>",
